---
const supportChannels = [
  {
    id: 'alipay',
    name: '支付宝',
    src: '/support/alipay.jpg',
    alt: '支付宝收款码',
    width: 1080,
    height: 1621,
    chip: 'bg-google-blue/10 text-[#185ABC] dark:text-google-blue',
  },
  {
    id: 'wechat',
    name: '微信',
    src: '/support/wechat.png',
    alt: '微信收款码',
    width: 1123,
    height: 1527,
    chip: 'bg-google-green/10 text-[#137333] dark:text-google-green',
  },
];
---

<section id="support" class="scroll-mt-20">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-5 sm:px-8 py-16 sm:py-20">
    <div class="max-w-3xl">
      <p class="text-sm font-medium text-primary tracking-wider">支持项目</p>
      <h2 class="mt-3 text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-on-surface">
        支持原点系列持续维护。
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-3 text-base text-on-surface-variant">
        如果这些工具节省了你的时间，可以通过支付宝或微信自愿赞助。赞助将用于功能优化、问题修复、发布维护和必要的开发成本。
      </p>
      <p class="mt-4 text-sm text-on-surface-variant/80">
        赞助不是使用条件，应用的下载、开源与隐私承诺不受影响。
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-8 grid grid-cols-1 gap-5 sm:grid-cols-2 sm:gap-6">
      {supportChannels.map((channel) => (
        <details class="m3-card group p-5 sm:p-6">
          <summary class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 rounded-(--radius-m3) select-none [&::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
              <span class={`inline-flex items-center h-8 px-3 rounded-full text-xs font-medium ${channel.chip}`}>
                {channel.name}
              </span>
              <span class="font-medium text-on-surface group-open:hidden">展开收款码</span>
              <span class="hidden font-medium text-on-surface group-open:inline">收起收款码</span>
            </div>
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="h-5 w-5 shrink-0 text-on-surface-variant transition-transform group-open:rotate-180" aria-hidden="true">
              <path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path>
            </svg>
          </summary>
          <div class="mt-5 rounded-[20px] bg-white p-3 shadow-m3-1">
            <img
              src={channel.src}
              alt={channel.alt}
              width={channel.width}
              height={channel.height}
              loading="lazy"
              class="mx-auto h-auto w-full max-w-[260px] rounded-[14px]"
            />
          </div>
        </details>
      ))}
    </div>

    <p class="mt-6 text-center text-xs text-on-surface-variant/70">
      扫码前请确认收款方信息，按需自愿支持。
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<script>
  const panels = document.querySelectorAll<HTMLDetailsElement>('#support details');
  panels.forEach((panel) => {
    panel.querySelector('summary')?.addEventListener('click', (event) => {
      // 统一切换两个收款码，避免网格等高时出现另一侧空白。
      event.preventDefault();
      const open = !panel.open;
      panels.forEach((item) => { item.open = open; });
    });
  });
</script>
